  "description": "XASDOO crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H102 Dy4 N18 O16 4+,4(Cl1 O4 1-),x(C3 H7 N1 O1),x(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.721-4.220 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.54-123.41°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(μ3-OH)2(L1)2(μ2-OH)2(DMF)4]·4ClO4 (C72H102Cl4Dy4N18O32). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
